    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n71140" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νυγ-μός</span></b> , ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>pricking sensation, irritation,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ruf.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				8.24.62
			</span></i> : in pl., of gout, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Ocyp.</u>
				30
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> metaph., of
			the <i>prickings</i> of conscience, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῶν παρανομημάτων ν. εἰς τὴν ψυχὴν
					λαμβάνειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.S.
					13.58
				</span></i>
			 ; but also, 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νύγμα</span>
			 II, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπὸ νυγμῶν καὶ γαργαλισμῶν τῆς
					αἰσθήσεως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Phil.</u>
					9
				</span></i>
			.</div>
